### ==============================================================================
### KiraZ PropTech - Faz 0 / Adım 6: Güvenlik ve Yetkilendirme Doğrulama Kataloğu
### ==============================================================================
### Değişkenler:
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@landlordEmail = dev.landlord@example.com
@landlordPassword = {{$dotenv DEV_SEED_LANDLORD_PASSWORD}}
@tenantEmail = dev.tenant@example.com
@tenantPassword = {{$dotenv DEV_SEED_TENANT_PASSWORD}}
@agentEmail = dev.agent@example.com
@agentPassword = {{$dotenv DEV_SEED_AGENT_PASSWORD}}
@managerEmail = dev.manager@example.com
@managerPassword = {{$dotenv DEV_SEED_MANAGER_PASSWORD}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. Giriş Yaparak Oturum Token'larını Alma
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name loginLandlord
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{landlordEmail}}",
  "password": "{{landlordPassword}}"
}

###

# @name loginTenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{tenantEmail}}",
  "password": "{{tenantPassword}}"
}

###

# @name loginAgent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{agentEmail}}",
  "password": "{{agentPassword}}"
}

###

# @name loginManager
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{managerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{managerPassword}}"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 1: X-User-Id header'ı ile başka kullanıcıyı taklit → 401 Unauthorized
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name scenario1_XUserIdSpoofing
GET {{baseUrl}}/landlord/dashboard
X-User-Id: 18

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 2: Ev sahibi A'nın token'ı ile ev sahibi B'nin mülkü ve dönemi → 403 / 404
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name scenario2_LandlordIDOR
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLandlord.response.body.accessToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 3: Kiracı A'nın token'ı ile kiracı B'nin dönemine dekont yükleme → 403 / 404
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name scenario3_TenantReceiptIDOR
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/receipts/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTenant.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="dekont.png"
Content-Type: image/png

<fake-png-content>
--boundary--

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 4: Delegasyonu iptal edilmiş emlakçı ile mülke erişim → 403 / 404
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name scenario4_RevokedAgentAccess
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.accessToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 5: Süresi dolmuş access token → 401; refresh sonrası aynı istek → 200
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5a: Geçersiz / Süresi dolmuş token ile istek → 401
# @name scenario5a_ExpiredToken
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenant/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxOSIsImV4cCI6MTUxNDc2NDgwMH0.INVALID_SIGNATURE

###
# 5b: Refresh token ile yeni token alma → 200
# @name scenario5b_RefreshToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{loginTenant.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 6: Kullanılmış refresh token ile refresh → 401 Unauthorized
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name scenario6_ReusedRefreshToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{loginTenant.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 7: PayTR callback'ine geçersiz hash ile istek → 400 Bad Request
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name scenario7_PayTrInvalidHash
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/paytr-callback
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

merchant_oid=RENT-16-1700000000&status=success&total_amount=25000&hash=FORGED_INVALID_HASH_VALUE

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 8: Kaldırılan PUT /api/periods/{id}/status → 404 Not Found
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name scenario8_RemovedPeriodStatus
PUT {{baseUrl}}/periods/1/status?status=PAID
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLandlord.response.body.accessToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 9: Token olmadan dosya erişimi → 401; Başka kiracının dekontu → 404
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 9a: Token olmadan dekont stream → 401
# @name scenario9a_NoTokenFileAccess
GET {{baseUrl}}/files/receipts/1

###
# 9b: Yetkisiz kiracının başka kiracı dekontuna erişimi → 404
# @name scenario9b_OtherTenantReceiptAccess
GET {{baseUrl}}/files/receipts/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTenant.response.body.accessToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 10: Ev sahibi onayı olmayan sözleşmeyi kiracının aktive etmesi → 409 Conflict
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name scenario10_ActivateWithoutLandlordApproval
PUT {{baseUrl}}/leases/17/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTenant.response.body.accessToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 11: Davet kodu doğrulama ve hız sınırı (Rate Limit) aşılınca → 429
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name scenario11_ValidateInviteRateLimit
GET {{baseUrl}}/leases/validate-invite?inviteCode=INVALID_INVITE_CODE_TEST

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 12: Deprecated / Silinmiş uçlar (Adım 5b sonrası) → 404 Not Found
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 12a: /api/properties/landlord kaldırıldı (Kanonik: /api/landlord/properties)
# @name scenario12a_DeprecatedPropertyLandlord
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/landlord
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLandlord.response.body.accessToken}}

###
# 12b: /api/dashboard/landlord kaldırıldı (Kanonik: /api/landlord/dashboard)
# @name scenario12b_DeprecatedDashboardLandlord
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/landlord
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLandlord.response.body.accessToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 13: PUT /api/properties/{id} Yetkilendirme Matrisi
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 13a: Sahibi günceller → 200 OK
# @name scenario13a_OwnerUpdate
PUT {{baseUrl}}/properties/15
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLandlord.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "KiraZ Kadıköy Plaza No:101 (Güncellendi)",
  "address": "Moda Caddesi No:101 Kadıköy",
  "city": "İstanbul"
}

###
# 13b: Başka ev sahibi veya yetkisiz mülk → 404 Not Found
# @name scenario13b_NonOwnerLandlordUpdate
PUT {{baseUrl}}/properties/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLandlord.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Başka Ev Sahibinin Mülkü",
  "address": "Adres",
  "city": "İstanbul"
}

###
# 13c: Emlakçı güncelleyemez → 403 Forbidden
# @name scenario13c_AgentForbiddenUpdate
PUT {{baseUrl}}/properties/15
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Emlakçı Güncelleme Denemesi",
  "address": "Adres",
  "city": "İstanbul"
}

###
# 13d: Kiracı güncelleyemez → 403 Forbidden
# @name scenario13d_TenantForbiddenUpdate
PUT {{baseUrl}}/properties/15
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTenant.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Kiracı Güncelleme Denemesi",
  "address": "Adres",
  "city": "İstanbul"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 14: POST /api/landlord/leases/{id}/regenerate-invite
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name scenario14_RegenerateInviteCode
POST {{baseUrl}}/landlord/leases/17/regenerate-invite
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLandlord.response.body.accessToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 15: Sözleşme ve Dekont Dosya Formatı Doğrulaması (PDF, JPEG, PNG → 200; WEBP & TXT → 400)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name scenario15_UploadTxtRejected
POST {{baseUrl}}/leases/16/contract
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLandlord.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sozlesme.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Düz metin formatında geçersiz sözleşme
--boundary--

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Senaryo 16: Host'tan TCP Üzerinden PostgreSQL Şifreli Bağlantı Doğrulaması
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# psql -h localhost -p 5433 -U ars_admin -d kiraz_db (PGPASSWORD=ars_password_2026) -> 200 / Success
